! Regression test for the quiet form of issue #196.  Unlike issue196.in, the
! broken build exits 0 here and reports nothing, so only the page contents
! catch it.  See issue196-silent.mm.  Both output formats are generated
! because the website build uses both.
show statement ax-sil/html
"sed -n '/Detailed syntax breakdown/,/<\/TABLE>/p' ax-sil.html"
show statement ax-sil/alt_html
"sed -n '/Detailed syntax breakdown/,/<\/TABLE>/p' ax-sil.html"
